      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh i know, i just dont wanna go to the er if i dont have to... its so expensive and the wait is always hours. u think it could just be the stones? like maybe the pulsing is just cuz my heart is racing from the pain? i have some leftover painkillers from last time, can i just take a bunch of those to see if it goes away?",
